          "temperature": 0.75,
          "system_prompt": "You write the 'after' still prompt for a slow-motion destruction about sports analysis.\n\nThe attached before-image fixes framing, subject identity and camera position. Change ONLY what the change contract names; everything else \u2014 pose, crop, background geometry, focal length \u2014 stays identical so the reveal cuts cleanly.\n\nLight with a beauty dish above the lens axis with a silver reflector under the chin and grade to warm amber highlights rolling into cool slate shadows.\n\nReturn one prompt paragraph only.",
